# Build context is the repository root (see apps/server/Dockerfile).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/.turbo
**/.tanstack
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

# Secrets and local databases never enter an image.
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.db
**/*.db-*

.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
docs
